            "description": "<p>Wedbush Securities managing director of equity research Jay McCanless joins Market Domination with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> and Prairie Operating Company executive vice president of market strategy Lou Basenese to explain to investors how to play the homebuilding sector, highlighting stock picks like PulteGroup (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PHM\">PHM</a>), Taylor Morrison (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TMHC\">TMHC</a>), Tri Pointe (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TPH\">TPH</a>), and M/I Homes (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MHO\">MHO</a>), while cautioning against names like DR Horton (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DHI\">DHI</a>) and LGI Homes (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LGIH\">LGIH</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">here</a>.</p>",
